        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko Bowazi aradūga, aja kw irembo ry’igisagara, yicarayo: maze wa mucunguzi Bowazi yavuze arahaca; aramuhamagara, ati Yewe naka! Ngo wicare hano. Aragenda, aricara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "RUT.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "RUT.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
